          "text": "SIDECHAIN PUMP\n\nClassic EDM sidechain compression.\n\nSignal flow:\n- Clock -> Drum Seq (4-on-the-floor kick)\n- Drum Seq gate-kick -> 909 Kick trigger\n- Supersaw pad -> VCF -> Gain -> Compressor main input\n- Kick audio -> Compressor SIDECHAIN input\n- Kick + compressed pad -> Mixer-8 -> Reverb -> Out\n\nThe pumping effect:\n- Threshold -35dB = very sensitive to kick\n- Ratio 16:1 = heavy ducking\n- Attack 0.5ms = instant duck\n- Release 180ms = smooth rhythmic pump\n\nTry tweaking:\n- Release 80ms = tight pump\n- Release 350ms = deep, slow pump\n- Ratio 4:1 = subtle ducking\n- Ratio 20:1 = extreme ducking"
